.SH BUGS
On SunOS, possibly on other operating systems too, attempting to write
to two CD-Writers on the same SCSI bus will cause errors.  Depending on the
CD authoring software it may even crash your entire system.

DVD writers may behave similarly; they have not been tested to date.

